---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';
---

<Layout title="陈冠宇 - Curriculum Vitae">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 py-12 sm:py-16 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 font-serif leading-relaxed transition-colors duration-300 min-h-screen">

    <Navigation />

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="text-center mb-14 pb-8 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-medium tracking-wide text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">陈冠宇</h1>
      <p class="text-lg italic text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-2 font-serif">Shane Lorien</p>
      <ul class="font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500 mt-7 flex justify-center flex-wrap gap-x-3 gap-y-1 uppercase tracking-[0.14em]">
        <li>Peking University</li>
        <li aria-hidden="true">·</li>
        <li>B.E. Computer Science, 2025</li>
        <li aria-hidden="true">·</li>
        <li><a href="mailto:logic.dreemurr@gmail.com" class="hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-slate-200 transition-colors normal-case tracking-normal">logic.dreemurr@gmail.com</a></li>
        <li aria-hidden="true">·</li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/logic61" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-slate-200 transition-colors normal-case tracking-normal">github.com/logic61</a></li>
      </ul>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-12">

      <!-- Education -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 pb-2 mb-5 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Education</h2>
        <article>
          <header class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
            <h3 class="text-lg text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">北京大学 · Peking University</h3>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500 tabular-nums shrink-0">Sep 2025 -</span>
          </header>
          <p class="italic text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">信息科学技术学院 · B.E. 计算机科学与技术</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-2">相关课程：程序设计实习, 人工智能基础.</p>
        </article>
      </section>

      <!-- Selected Projects -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 pb-2 mb-5 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Selected Projects</h2>
        <div class="space-y-7">

          <article>
            <header class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
              <h3 class="text-lg text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">
                <a href="https://github.com/ruguo0119/dog-emotion-recognition" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline underline-offset-4 decoration-slate-300">Dog Emotion Recognition</a>
              </h3>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500 tabular-nums shrink-0">Python · 2026</span>
            </header>
            <p class="italic text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">通过姿态与声纹识别犬类意图</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2">北京大学创新+工作站项目. 已通过开题答辩, 当前推进中.</p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <header class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
              <h3 class="text-lg text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">
                <a href="https://github.com/Logic61/PKU-Planner" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline underline-offset-4 decoration-slate-300">PKU-Planner</a>
              </h3>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500 tabular-nums shrink-0">C++ · 2025</span>
            </header>
            <p class="italic text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">适配北京大学教学网的课程与 DDL 助手</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2">视觉驱动的任务紧迫度提示, 任务随截止临近变色. 支持教学网导入与截图识别课程. 集成一键 AI 个性化建议.</p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <header class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
              <h3 class="text-lg text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">
                <a href="https://github.com/Logic61/Obsidian-to-Hexo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline underline-offset-4 decoration-slate-300">Obsidian-to-Hexo</a>
              </h3>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500 tabular-nums shrink-0">Python · 2025</span>
            </header>
            <p class="italic text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Obsidian 笔记至 Hexo 博客的迁移工具</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2">解析 Obsidian 特有 Markdown 语法, 自动整理元数据并写入 Hexo posts 目录, 支持批量备份与发布.</p>
          </article>

        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Skills -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 pb-2 mb-5 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Technical Skills</h2>
        <dl class="grid grid-cols-[120px_1fr] gap-y-3 text-sm">
          <dt class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500 self-baseline pt-0.5">Languages</dt>
          <dd class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">C++, Python</dd>

          <dt class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500 self-baseline pt-0.5">Frameworks</dt>
          <dd class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">PyTorch</dd>

          <dt class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500 self-baseline pt-0.5">GPU</dt>
          <dd class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">CUDA, Triton, TileLang <span class="italic text-slate-500">(beginner)</span></dd>

          <dt class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500 self-baseline pt-0.5">Tools</dt>
          <dd class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Git / GitHub, LaTeX, Markdown</dd>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <!-- Activities -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 pb-2 mb-5 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Selected Activities</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">

          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
            <p>Piano. Performed Chopin Ballade No. 1, Grande Polonaise Brillante, Liszt Rigoletto and Chasse-neige.</p>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 tabular-nums shrink-0">ongoing</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
            <p>北京大学导引队. <span class="italic text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500">团体第四名, 五禽戏项目, 首都高校健身气功比赛</span>.</p>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 tabular-nums shrink-0">2026 Spring</span>
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

    </div>

    <footer class="mt-16 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 flex justify-between flex-wrap gap-2">
      <span>Last updated Sep 2026</span>
      <span>Beijing, China</span>
    </footer>

  </main>
</Layout>
